the helper to return a dense tensor and, in the same edit, dedented its `def`
to column 0. That ends the class body early, and the next method's
indentation no longer matches anything, so generate_datasets.py raises
IndentationError on import and cannot build <data_set>.pkl at all. Only the
indentation is restored; upstream's dense-tensor change is kept.

Applied after the CRLF strip, against LF line endings.

